#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:76
msgid "Required Role Permissions"
msgstr "Permissions de rôle requises"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/routers/route_redistributions.rst:78
msgid ""
"Access to route redistribution management requires the ``Infrastructure: "
"Network Router Redistribution`` permission (``infrastructure-network-"
"router-redistribution``) with ``read`` or ``full`` access."
msgstr "L'accès à la gestion de la redistribution de routes nécessite la permission ``Infrastructure: Network Router Redistribution`` (``infrastructure-network-router-redistribution``) avec un accès ``read`` ou ``full``."

